{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s12-p01",
      "text": "If you love reading books, you must know about The Little Prince.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p02",
      "text": "It's a famous novel written by a French writer.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p03-01",
      "text": "As one of the best-selling books in history,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p03-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p03-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p03-02",
      "text": "it has been sold as many as 200 million copies in 253 languages and dialects.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p03-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p03-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p04-01",
      "text": "Around 70 years after the birth of the book,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p04-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p04-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p04-02",
      "text": "an American director has found a way to make it into a 3D animated film.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p04-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p04-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p05",
      "text": "The book tells the story of a pilot, called The Aviator, who crashes in a desert, rather than an airport.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p06",
      "text": "In the film, the story starts years after the crash, when The Aviator is much older.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p07",
      "text": "He has got a new neighbour called The Little Girl.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p08",
      "text": "He tells The Little Girl about his time in the desert.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p09",
      "text": "His story takes her to an amazing world.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p10",
      "text": "China is the first country in the world to see the film in two versions, in Chinese and English.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p11",
      "text": "The film tells The Little Prince's story in a beautiful way.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p12",
      "text": "Film tickets were quickly sold out in many cinemas and local theatres across the country.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p13-01",
      "text": "The film has received a prize,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p13-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p13-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p13-02",
      "text": "for it is like a childhood dream,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p13-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p13-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p13-03",
      "text": "which is lost by most adults in this stressed-out society.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p13-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p13-03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p14",
      "text": "The radio stations also did interviews with the voice actors and actresses who addressed their thankfulness.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p15",
      "text": "And the most touching part is that every adult was a good-natured kid like The Little Prince.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12-p16",
      "text": "And it's a pity that this good characteristic goes away, as time flies.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s12-p16.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
